   "text": {
    "L1": "A community is a group of people who live in the same place and help each other.",
    "L2": "It is bigger than one family. Neighbours and helpers are part of it too.",
    "L3": "People do different jobs, such as selling vegetables, sweeping, guarding and teaching.",
    "L4": "Every job matters because people in a community depend on one another.",
    "L5": "When people share jobs, big work gets done faster and becomes easier.",
    "L6": "Cleaning drives, tree planting and festivals bring people closer when we do them together.",
    "L7": "Now choose the cleaning plan that shows people sharing different jobs."
   },
